nA3nVBMrfGfqiefzD8jroD9x3KCydQuzoA73NIo3MdAEPKuNAVVnD0q8xT5zk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1VMybog3albpRPN7M1x1nI6r7qbBY_hXCU4ej008l7zQ&oe=69D27BE3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "567635975249006", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003243_567635978582339_385010080011966976_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7vqOebnWxW0Q7kNvwGfPixa&_nc_oc=Adrk34mJhJ19KH503rvBIlrEM-giXOkoZIDHzlyHUWnSPKrkELgaCpKBTj3yIwD7PxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2oxO0rb0sy-Vp57te71flc1mXqC1VwpC-35Wo2G3WHow&oe=69D27512"}, "display_name": "Little Planet: Escape to a new life", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Little Planet! With the roar of the spaceship, you landed at a lovely planet\u2014\u2014\nYou can escape into a fantasy, ever-growing and a whole new life. Explore and decorate your own little planet, which is full of  excitement, fun items, creatures, and scenery. \n\nMissions? Rather some reminders:\n- The backpack fills up quickly? You need to learn to manage your inventory strategically.\n- Complete terrain editing independently, making a maze is also a great choice!\n- Find a way to get gifts floating in the air.\n- Pay off your debts! Otherwise, you will be sent back to Earth! (Just kidding :) )\n- Fishing? Try to master casting the rod first.\n- Build your beautiful garden from scratch!\n- Look for scattered easter eggs.\n- Never drop items by the sea or else...\n- Make a room that is more aesthetic than the sample room.\n- Be kind to everyone, whether it's a player or an NPC (No animal cruelty!)\netc...\n \nNot available here: hustle and bustle,tedious, academic pressure, tests, cat's paw, endless competition. \nIt's your show time to demonstrate your extraordinary wisdom, aesthetics planning ability, strategic thinking and a beautiful mind looking forward to a better life.", "short_descriptio